{"product_id":"terror-on-the-training-ground","title":"Terror on the Training Ground","description":"\u003cp\u003eTerry Triceratops is the manager of Dinosaur FC. With the team at the bottom of the Premiership, the chairman brings in fitness trainer Hans Hadrosaur to whip the dinos back into shape. If the team drops out of the league, then Terry faces the sack. So the Dino FC players are determined to secure a win against Jurassic Park Rangers.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Keith Brumpton\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781409504832\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 89\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45834338566297,"sku":"17RD-39781409504832","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ff768caf528_Terror_on_the_Training_Ground_Keith_Brumpton.jpg?v=1761588347","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/terror-on-the-training-ground","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}